meta {
  name: 54 - MCP - Invest get_live_price (direct)
  type: http
  seq: 54
}

post {
  url: http://localhost:8003/mcp/execute
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "tool": "get_live_price",
    "args": {
      "symbol": "RELIANCE.NS"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Direct MCP call — pure external API (Yahoo Finance via yfinance), no DB/user_id.
  Expect a live price for RELIANCE.NS. If the container has no internet or Yahoo
  rate-limits, price may be null — that's the honest external-dependency caveat.
}
